      "created_at": "2026-07-28T14:05:00Z",
      "text": "I reproduced the latency. Traffic is normal, but shard 3 memory climbs while compaction runs. I have paused it and linked Beacon incident INC-208.",
      "visibility": "support",
      "updated_at": "2026-07-28T14:05:00Z",
      "source_url": "https://pulse.summit.test/channels/support-northwind/msg_7001"
    },
    {
      "source_system": "pulse",
      "record_id": "msg_7002",
      "id": "msg_7002",
