      },
      "created_at": "2026-07-29T09:02:00Z",
      "text": "Tomorrow Elena will want to know whether analysts are still affected, what we know versus suspect, and whether the October renewal timeline is at risk. We also owe Tomas a date for the capacity review.",
      "visibility": "customer-success",
      "updated_at": "2026-07-29T09:02:00Z",
      "source_url": "https://pulse.summit.test/channels/customer-success/msg_7003"
    },
    {
